<view class="page me-hub"><view class="preview-top"><view>CRUXSET</view><view class="preview-avatar"></view></view><view class="page-title">我的</view><view class="page-lead">管理你的资料、墙面与线路。</view><view class="hub-card profile" bindtap="openProfile"><view class="hub-title">个人资料</view><view class="hub-meta">设置 CruxSet 昵称与微信身份信息</view><view class="hub-arrow">›</view></view><view class="hub-card walls" bindtap="openWalls"><view class="hub-title">我的墙面</view><view class="hub-meta">仅显示自己拥有的墙面</view><view class="hub-arrow">›</view></view><view class="hub-card problems" bindtap="openProblems"><view class="hub-title">我的线路</view><view class="hub-meta">{{problemCount}} 条线路 · 仅显示我创建的线路</view><view class="hub-arrow">›</view></view><view wx:if="{{isAdmin}}" class="hub-card" bindtap="openManagement"><view class="hub-title">管理中心</view><view class="hub-meta">全站墙面与用户</view><view class="hub-arrow">›</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-card">{{error}}<button size="mini" bindtap="reload">重试</button></view></view>
